name 'csp_unit1_lesson18_cfu1_dev_27_28'
title 'Two Robot Flowcharts'

question 'Two students wrote flowcharts for the same robot, which starts on a grid facing north. Which of the following best describes the two flowcharts?'

wrong 'The flowcharts solve different problems because Flowchart B has more steps.'
wrong 'The flowcharts solve different problems because Flowchart A turns left and Flowchart B turns right.'
wrong 'The flowcharts solve the same problem because both have two move forward steps.'
right 'The flowcharts solve the same problem because the robot draws the same trail, even though the steps are different.'

allow_multiple_attempts true